>Dunbar's Bedroom
This is Ms. Dunbar's room. It is furnished in the usual style, with a few
additions indicative of Ms. Dunbar's taste. The bedroom door is open.
Sprawled on the floor is the body of Ms. Dunbar.
Next to the body, near a pool of blood, is a note.
Lying beside the body is a smoking gun.
Mr. Baxter is here.

